		{
			dependencies: ["4A9ED9AED58A6EC9"]
			id: "5697DC7D1A9839A3"
			rewards: [{
				id: "109D59816AFA00C5"
				item: {
					Count: 1
					ForgeCaps: {
						"celestisynth:celestisynthitemstackcapabilities": {
							cs.aquaSkin: 0
						}
					}
					id: "minecraft:written_book"
					tag: {
						author: "Mr6trt"
						pages: [
							"{\"text\":\"Before memory. Before time bore names. Before even the skies cracked open to light, the war began.\\n\\nThe Nether rose. Not with shouts, but with silence devouring realm after realm in ash and hunger.\"}"
							"{\"text\":\"And so, the angels looked to the world below. Not for strength… but for hope.\\n\\nIn a forgotten village, born beneath a moonless sky, was a child marked by breath not his own. A second soul flickered behind his eyes.\"}"
							"{\"text\":\"He was no prince. No warrior. Just an orphaned squire with calloused hands and a heart far too kind for the world he lived in.\\n\\nBut destiny has no patience for doubt.\"}"
							"{\"text\":\"On the eve of the Great Rift, as demons fell like fire from above, the squire bled — and the world shifted.\\n\\nPower surged from his wounds. Wings unseen broke the clouds. And from the heavens descended a voice:\"}"
							"{\"text\":\"“You are Chosen.”\\n\\nThe angels forged him an armor in waters not of this world, washed in the Light Beyond, cooled in rivers of starlight.\\nThey named it Tankiorus \\\"that which shall not fall.\\\"\"}"
							"{\"text\":\"Its chestplate bore the essence of the four foundations: iron for resolve, gold for spirit, diamond for clarity, and netherite for the edge of defiance. Holy runes etched by the divine scribes burned along its veins. Echoes of sanctity orbited its core.\"}"
							"{\"text\":\"And the armor could not be worn… unless the soul itself had been made whole.\\n\\nHe fought. Not for glory. Not for revenge. But because he must. With each breath, he shattered legions. With each step, the dead fled.\"}"
							"{\"text\":\"And at the Gates of Flame, where even angels dared not tread, he cast them all down. The hordes of the Nether fell screaming into the pit. Their curse was bound to the threshold. They would never rise again — unless the seal is broken.\"}"
							"{\"text\":\"In the end, only one piece remained.\\nThe chest. The heart.\\n\\nThe last breath of the last hero.\\n\\nBut to claim it now is to walk his path.\"}"
							"{\"text\":\"One must forge the sacred shapes once more.\\nOne must summon the runes, the echoes, the spark of blessing.\\nOne must be armored not just in strength — but in virtue.\\n\\nOnly the sanctified may wear the sacred.\"}"
							"{\"text\":\"And only those clad in gold not for pride, but for protection, may call upon the light that never dies.\\n\\nFor death shall forget their name.\\nAnd the flame shall never claim them.\"}"
						]
						title: "被选中者"
					}
				}
				type: "item"
			}]
			tasks: [{
				id: "0DCE1F8F970B3D28"
				item: "minecraft:iron_ingot"
				type: "item"
			}]
