		{
			dependencies: ["32428FA4B1FFA364"]
			id: "734A551E6575D1B4"
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "698EC94E00AE8E05"
					type: "xp"
					xp: 10
				}
				{
					id: "22E02898B4AB6233"
					item: {
						Count: 1
						ForgeCaps: {
							"celestisynth:celestisynthitemstackcapabilities": {
								cs.aquaSkin: 0
							}
						}
						id: "minecraft:written_book"
						tag: {
							author: "Mr6trt"
							pages: [
								"{\"text\":\"They say the god of the Deep was blind to the sky — but not to the stone. Where others saw only darkness, he saw lines. Paths. Secrets. Gold that whispered. Iron that wept. Redstone veins like blood in the earth. And so, he forged an eye.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"In his forge beneath the world, deeper than even the lava seas, the god shaped a tool of crimson fire. A pickaxe of ruby and wrath, set with a single burning eye that never closed. It did not blink, it did not sleep.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"It saw all — every crawling beast, every silent creeper, every heart beating in the dark.\\n\\nHis chosen wielded it not with strength, but with clarity. Where they struck, stone obeyed. Where they walked, riches followed.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"It was said that even the bedrock trembled when the Eye passed near.\\n\\nBut the god was jealous. He scattered the path to his treasure across the world, hiding it in trials that only the faithful could endure.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"To earn the Eye, one must prove their hunger.\\nDig deep. Deeper still. Gather the blood of the mountain: copper, coal, iron, lapis, redstone, gold, emerald, diamond, and what lies beyond.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"One must shape the tools of progress — from humble roots to divine edge. Wood, stone, iron, gold, diamond… and the metal that sings in the fire.\\n\\nAnd above all, one must find the buried heart.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"A jewel untouched by tools, a shard of the world’s first diamond. The Heart that beats once every thousand strikes.\\nOnly then will the Eye see you.Only then will the stone open itself to you.\\nBut beware. The Eye sees not only what is… but what hides.\"}"
							]
							title: "Deep Song"
						}
					}
					type: "item"
				}
			]
			tasks: [{
				id: "32A8483430421115"
				item: {
					Count: 1
